rfd_se3fast — add-on for RFdiffusion v1.
This package re-implements, for inference only, the evaluation of the SE(3)-Transformer layer used by RFdiffusion's Str2Str block.
* RFdiffusion (RosettaCommons/RFdiffusion, commit 86507b6538f51fce57b5a72477165f03999ed7ae) — BSD 3-Clause. `rfd_se3fast/dense_torch.py::str2str_forward_dense`
  transcribes the control flow of `rfdiffusion/Track_module.py::Str2Str.forward` (VENDORED_FROM header in the file).
* NVIDIA SE3Transformer (as vendored in RFdiffusion env/SE3Transformer at the same commit) — MIT. Layer semantics (ConvSE3, AttentionBlockSE3, basis layouts) are
  re-implemented against it; its sub-modules are called at run time; no source is copied.
* DGL — Apache-2.0; PyTorch — BSD; Triton — MIT; e3nn — MIT (runtime dependencies, not vendored).
